== Ratel OSS, local dev server: http://localhost:3131/api/mcp (git 0ca0bdd6)
== Server env: FF_EVAL_GATE=1 RATEL_EXPERIMENTAL_FEATURES=1 in-process cron ON (the eval-set refresh job runs in the background).
== Caller project 11111111-... (org 2222...). Customer project 55555555-... (org 4444...).

### initialize
$ curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3131/api/mcp -H 'Authorization: Bearer rtl_53…' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -H 'Accept: application/json, text/event-stream' -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"proof","version":"1"}}}' | jq '{serverInfo: .result.serverInfo, protocolVersion: .result.protocolVersion}'
{
  "serverInfo": {
    "name": "ratel",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18"
}

### a) change_task_eval_set add: run whose ask names the Customer org's project -> REFUSED expected
$ curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3131/api/mcp -H 'Authorization: Bearer rtl_53…' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -H 'Accept: application/json, text/event-stream' -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"change_task_eval_set","arguments":{"taskId":"cluster_intents","action":"add","runId":"aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-000000000001"}}}' | jq '{isError: (.result.isError // false), result: .result.structuredContent}'
{
  "isError": true,
  "result": {
    "ok": false,
    "error": "conflict",
    "message": "This run works on a project of another organization, so it cannot become an eval here."
  }
}

### b) draft_task_test: same foreign run -> REFUSED expected (before any model call)
$ curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3131/api/mcp -H 'Authorization: Bearer rtl_53…' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -H 'Accept: application/json, text/event-stream' -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"draft_task_test","arguments":{"taskId":"cluster_intents","runId":"aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-000000000001"}}}' | jq '{isError: (.result.isError // false), result: .result.structuredContent}'
{
  "isError": true,
  "result": {
    "ok": false,
    "error": "conflict",
    "message": "This run works on a project of another organization, so it cannot become an eval here."
  }
}

### c) control: change_task_eval_set add: run whose ask names no other org's project -> 'Run added.' expected
$ curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3131/api/mcp -H 'Authorization: Bearer rtl_53…' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -H 'Accept: application/json, text/event-stream' -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"change_task_eval_set","arguments":{"taskId":"cluster_intents","action":"add","runId":"aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-000000000002"}}}' | jq '{isError: (.result.isError // false), result: .result.structuredContent}'
{
  "isError": false,
  "result": {
    "ok": true,
    "operation_id": "change_task_eval_set",
    "data": {
      "taskId": "cluster_intents",
      "action": "add",
      "message": "Run added."
    },
    "hint": "get_task shows the task's eval set."
  }
}

### d) wait for the background refresh_task_eval_set job (the automatic pick from scored runs)
$ until psql ... -c "select 1 from jobs where kind='refresh_task_eval_set' and status='done'"; do sleep 2; done
         kind          | status 
-----------------------+--------
 score_tasks           | done
 refresh_task_eval_set | done
(2 rows)


### task_eval_cases rows in the proof DB (the foreign run ...0001 must not be there)
$ psql -d ratel_rp10_proof -c 'select task_id, turn_id, origin from task_eval_cases'
     task_id     |               turn_id                | origin 
-----------------+--------------------------------------+--------
 cluster_intents | aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-000000000002 | user
(1 row)


